menu "Power Manager — safety"
  config PM_ENABLE_PHYSICAL_OUTPUTS
    bool "ALLOW real DFR0473 relay energization (lab-qualified hardware only)"
    default n
    help
      Danger: this allows physical relays to energize under Modbus commands.
      Enable only AFTER external pull-down resistors, individual fuses,
      correctly rated wiring, INA228 high-side conversion, and bench safety
      validation. Default is false and ARM returns Modbus exception 0x03.
endmenu
